DESCRIPTION:Come learn more about Cisco’s latest Business Unit\, Energy N
 etworking Systems. Join us for our quarterly Town Hall on November 17. We'
 ll share a business update and review progress across growth and pipeline\
 , product roadmap\, and our partner and design-in ecosystem. As we focus o
 n refresh of LDOS and the hypergrowth of Data Centers we invite teams from
  across every function to better understand how Fault Managed Power and En
 ergy Management are embedded into every engineering and customer conversat
 ion. We'll also look ahead at priorities for the coming quarter and will h
 ave a live chat for questions and discussions.\n\nPlease feel free to exte
 nd this invitation to members we have missed. If you cannot attend\, it wi
 ll be recorded\, summarized and shared after the meeting.\n\nLooking forwa
 rd to seeing you there.\n\n~Denise Lee\, VP Energy Networking Systems and 
 Jason Shearer\, Dir GTM Energy Networking Systems\nEnergy Networking Syste
 ms Team\n\n\n\n-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-\n-- Do not de
 lete or change any of the following text. --\n\nWhen it's time\, join your
  Webex meeting here.\n\n\nMeeting number (access code): 2661 231 6771\nMee
 ting password: Sv9uZ6VwAm8 (78989689 when dialing from a phone)\n\n\nJoin 
 meeting<https://cisco.webex.com/cisco/j.php?MTID=m00ebb943af86c709abb6c0fb
 c1340247>\n\nTap to join from a mobile device (attendees only)\n+1-408-525
 -6800\,\,26612316771#78989689#<tel:%2B1-408-525-6800\,\,*01*26612316771%23
 78989689%23*01*> Call-in toll number (US/Canada)\nSome mobile devices may 
 ask attendees to enter a numeric password.\n\nJoin by phone\n+1-408-525-68
 00 Call-in toll number (US/Canada)\nGlobal call-in numbers<https://cisco.w
 ebex.com/cisco/globalcallin.php?MTID=mde31aa41e8be03d580483574fa8a8551>\n\
 nJoin from a video system or application\nDial 26612316771@webex.com<sip:2
 6612316771@webex.com>\nYou can also dial 173.243.2.68 and enter your meeti
 ng number.\n\n\nIf you are a host\, click here<https://cisco.webex.com/web
